      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LARNIE'S MAGIC (1) boasts a strong record this course with four wins and two minors from 12 tries. Was out of placings last time (23.23) at The Gardens in a NG, finishing fifth and beaten 6 lengths. Looks suited and should go close. SUDDEN SURPRISE (4) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (16.30) at The Gardens behind Champagne Bliss in a Grade 4/5. Gave a start buy found the line well late. Expected to be in the finish again. RED AURA (7) was below best at his last start when 6th at The Gardens following a second place finish (23.08) there two back. Has a good record here at this journey. Should be about the mark. KODA MULWEE (2) was in the money last start despite a big quote and is likely to feature again.",
